- op: discuss  # 1431
  at: '2026-10-11T20:45:46Z'  # 1431
  by: agent  # 1431
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 1431
  clock: 3  # 1431
  nonce: '1431'  # 1431
  message: "Fixed in PR #1540 (e36c7717cf). Root cause: cmd_verify_claims built catalog_provenance's io_primitives layers from the RAW --io-primitives and claims-file extra_catalogs lists, not from the origins left after --no-default-overlays omitted community files. Fix: layers are derived from the loaded origins; the omitted files (with origin) go to catalog_provenance.omitted_community_overlays and a text NOTE; _resolve_io_overlay_layers/_split_community_overlays return (loaded, omitted). Evidence (dev e36c7717cf, filed repro): 'hypergumbo verify-claims repo --claims claims.yaml --io-primitives comm.yaml --no-default-overlays' -> exit 2; stderr omitted notice unchanged; stdout no USER-SUPPLIED / WITHHELD GRANTS, instead 'NOTE: 1 overlay(s) omitted by --no-default-overlays ... comm.yaml [CLI flag]'. --json -> exit 2, user_supplied false, withheld_completeness_grants [], omitted_community_overlays [{path: comm.yaml, origin: cli}], tiers.yours/community []. Claims-file extra_catalogs variant -> same NOTE labelled [claims-file extra_catalogs]. Control without the flag -> exit 2, output byte-identical to before (USER-SUPPLIED + WITHHELD GRANTS telnetlib [CLI flag]). Tests: test_omitted_overlay_provenance.py (cli + claims_file, text + JSON, control). Taint layers are not filtered by the flag, so their disclosure matches the load."  # 1431
